  \[\begin{aligned}
  P(92\leq X\leq 104)&\approx& \Phi\left (\frac{104-100}{7.071}\right) -\Phi\left(\frac{92-100}{7.071} \right)\\
                           & =& \Phi(0.57)- \Phi(-1.13)\\
                            &=& \Phi(0.57)- (1-\Phi(1.13))\\
                            &=& \Phi(0.57)+\Phi(1.13)-1\\
                            &=&0.716+0.871-1\\
                            &=&0.586.
  \end{aligned}\] Note que \(\sqrt{n p(1-p)}=7.071\) e \(np=100\).

